piano: add Advanced > Fix GPT using the Nabu x/j/k/w command sequence.

Run through the normal confirmation/worker action, release piano's existing
crypto mounts and mappings, reject active MSC, and report each gdisk result.
No stock partition templates or device-specific sector constants are used.

